再接着痛哭流涕 然后是因为哭而哭
the ugly cry, the cry because you're crying,

346
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:38,640
再然后是你刚说完不哭 又开始哭
the cry after you say you're not gonna cry anymore,

347
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:40,480
至于最后那阶段 估计都是被我弄哭的
and then the final cry, which is probably my fault.

348
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:45,840
你错了 麦克斯 我这次不会哭
Well, you're wrong, Max, I'm not gonna cry over this,

349
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,620
因为我对他的感情还没有这么深
because I haven't gone far enough down the road.

350
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:50,100
没错 虽然我是开始幻想我们的未来了
Yes, I was just beginning to think about our future,

351
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:51,160
