不是 他是说他的甜点很重
No, I think he meant his dessert is heavy.

365
00:17:24,740 --> 00:17:26,260
但没错 你的心情很复杂
But yeah, you got a lot going on.

366
00:17:27,460 --> 00:17:28,660
你想让我们帮你做什么
So what do you want us to do?

367
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:30,680
打他一顿吗 还是玩爆他的菊花
Should we throw down? Mess his ass up?

368
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:31,740
踢他的脸一脚
Kick him in the face?

369
00:17:32,360 --> 00:17:34,420
还是什么都不做 免得被踢出学校
Or just ignore it so I don't get kicked out of school?

370
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,780
不用了 晚点我自己找尼古拉斯
No, I'll deal with Nicolas later.

371
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:38,700
你确定吗
You sure?

372
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,700
我可是一直都想杀一个法国佬
'cause I've always wanted to kill a French person.

373
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:44,280
再杀一次
Again.

374
00:17:47,780 --> 00:17:50,160
谢啦 但你别管了 我能处理
Thanks, but stay out of it. I've got this.

375
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:52,200
我要把他碎尸万段
I'm gonna rip him a new one.

376
00:17:53,460 --> 00:17:54,580
-早安 卡洛琳 -早啊 尼古拉斯
- Bonjour, Caroline. - Bonjour, Nicolas.

377
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:58,200
那不算碎尸 碎花都算不上
That wasn't a rip. Wasn't even a tear.

378
00:18:00,300 --> 00:18:01,680
你们俩 快进去
Go, go, you two.

379
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:03,520
给新鲜出炉的大洞洞蛋糕让路
Got a big, hot bundt here.

380
