去吧 别迟到了
Go, go, don't be late.

381
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,140
你确定这是"在嘴咬嚼"吗
You sure that's a croquembouche?

382
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:09,900
看起来就像是土狼的粪堆
'cause it looks like a coyote poop tree.

383
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:14,480
卡洛琳 你能进去帮我看着电话吗
Caroline, can you watch the phones for me

384
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:16,480
我要传尼古拉斯老婆的留言给他
while I give Chef Nicolas this note from his wife?

385
