你做得到 你做得到
You have got this. You have got this.

391
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,920
你都甩过肯尼迪家的高富帅了
You broke up with a Kennedy cousin.

392
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:40,940
你能做到
You can do this.

393
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:43,240
卡洛琳 找我有事吗
Caroline, do you need something?

394
00:18:43,820 --> 00:18:46,620
我只是来送电话留言给你
I just wanted to give you this phone message you just got.

395
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:48,180
是你老婆留的
From your wife.

396
00:18:50,020 --> 00:18:53,340
你妻子 朱丽叶
