398
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:58,000
是啊 刚才留言的就是我老婆啊
Yes, you just got a message from my wife.

399
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:03,180
我觉得是不是咱俩语言不通有歧义
I feel like something's getting lost in the translation here,

400
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:06,760
那恕我直言 我们之间完了
So let me be clear. It's over between us.

401
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:07,640
为什么
