411
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:40,820
不管你和朱丽叶的协议是什么
And whatever arrangement you and Juliette have,

412
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:42,200
反正我们玩完了
it's over between you and me.

413
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:42,800
给
Here.

414
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:48,720
你生气的时候好可爱
You are very cute when you're angry.

415
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:50,520
是吗
I am?

416
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:53,400
