你没事吧 他说什么了
Are you okay? What did he say?

434
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:39,020
他说他结婚了 反正一片混乱
He said he's married, and it's confusing,

435
00:20:39,100 --> 00:20:39,940
而我很可口
and I'm delicious.

436
00:20:40,820 --> 00:20:42,940
好吧 他已婚 事混乱 你可口
Okay, well, he's married, it's confusing, and you're delicious.

437
00:20:42,940 --> 00:20:43,860
所以你是可口·圣克劳太太
So you're Mrs. Delicious Saintcroix.

438
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,020
你们结束了 对吗
So it's over, right?

439
00:20:48,340 --> 00:20:51,080
当然结束了 没有大吵大闹 没有哭哭啼啼
Yeah, of course it's over. No drama, no more crying.

440
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,740
我绝不会跟已婚男人在一起
I would never be with a married man.

441
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:53,900
是啊 那更像是我会做的事
Yeah, that's more my thing.

442
00:20:56,100 --> 00:20:57,220
天啊 麦克斯
Oh, my God, Max,

443
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:58,400
你知道我刚意识到什么吗
you know what I just realized?

444
